\n$$\n\\left(\\dfrac{3}{5}\\right)^2\n$$\n\nwith multiplication signs:\n\n$$\n(\\frac{3}{5})^{2} = \\frac{3}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{5}_(⏟)_([math]\\color{blue}2[/math] times)\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate the product of the two fractions. We multiply the numerators, and we multiply the denominators:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n(\\frac{3}{5})^{2} &= \\frac{3}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{5} \\\\\n&= \\frac{3 \\cdot 3}{5 \\cdot 5} \\\\\n&= \\frac{9}{25}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\left(\\dfrac{3}{5}\\right)^2= \\dfrac{9}{25}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148793 #edb/ref 1065 8806 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148793 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "f0e87aeb-338c-5f8d-be18-59b85ed28aac" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148793 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499647 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186500434 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499647 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045461 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499647 #edb/ref 1045 "Decimal and Fraction Operations Applied to Commercial Settings" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499647 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186500434 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499647 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "632fec14-e615-5a75-b6e7-2f7a4be02080" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499777 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{289}{16}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499777 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499777 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "41d5f79a-7cdd-5989-a575-2e2a2e47857b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499943 #edb/ref 1080 "1\\frac{1}{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499943 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499943 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "93939cfc-7735-587d-9f9b-25710f4c3ff2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499944 #edb/ref 1080 "2.82" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499944 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499944 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "947b69ff-cffc-5c2b-8520-98f7dfd675ed" #edb/ref 17592186045417]